---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Writing about software engineering, AI, and things I've built.
permalink: /blog/
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="hero__lede">Writing about software engineering, AI, and things I've built.</p>

<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in blog.listed %}
    <li class="post-card">
      <div class="post-card__text">
        {% if post.series %}
          <p class="post-series">{{ post.series.name }} &middot; Part {{ post.series.part }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="post-card__title" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.emoji }} {{ post.displayTitle }}</a>
        {% if post.description %}<p class="post-card__description">{{ post.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="post-card__meta">
          <time datetime="{{ post.createdAt }}">{{ post.createdAt | longDate }}</time>
          &middot; {{ post.readingMinutes }} min read
        </p>
      </div>
      {% if post.image %}
        {# Decorative: the title beside it already names the post. #}
        <img class="post-card__thumb" src="{{ post.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      {% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
